From: Ranjani Sridharan <ranjani.sridharan@linux.intel.com>
Date: Tue, 13 Feb 2024 12:12:43 +0200
Subject: [PATCH] ASoC: SOF: topology: Parse DAI type token for dspless mode
MIME-Version: 1.0
